# Credentials for harness integrations. Copy to mcp/.env (git-ignored) and fill in.
# Agents read these via scripts/MCP servers; never paste values into chat or commit them.

# --- Issue tracker (Jira Data Center: personal access token as Bearer; Jira Cloud: email + API token)
